# Optional settings for the local harvest server. Defaults are shown.
# The standalone Python script's folder: its config.json supplies the environment URLs, discovery
# queries and the optional OAuth client, and its saved runs show up in the workspace.
# HARVEST_SCRIPT_DIR=C:\Users\mpathan\claude-projects\bom-generation
# HARVEST_CONFIG=C:\Users\mpathan\claude-projects\bom-generation\config.json
# PORT=3000
# Optional AI suggestion step (off when no key). It only suggests, on request. It sends the asked rows' material names,
# articles and PDAM catalog candidates to the provider (via OpenRouter, also to the model provider behind it).
# Set the key in your terminal rather than in a file:  $env:OPENROUTER_API_KEY = "sk-or-..."
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# AI_PROVIDER=openrouter   (only needed when both keys exist)
